### Vulnerability: Arbitrary update
### Explanation: The contract accepts UpdateApplication calls from any address without authorization checks, allowing any user to modify the global state arbitrarily by providing a new value in the application arguments.
### Risk: Critical - Allows complete compromise of contract state and functionality by unauthorized parties.
